<div class="subsection" id="g_t_0411_0430_0437_043e_0432_0430_044f-_043d_0430_0441_0442_0440_043e_0439_043a_0430-_0441-_043c_0430_043d_0438_0444_0435_0441_0442_0430_043c_0438">
<div class="header">
<p>
Next: <a href="Trebuemye-pakety.html" accesskey="n" rel="next">Требуемые пакеты</a>, Up: <a href="Guix-profili-na-praktike.html" accesskey="u" rel="up">Guix профили на практике</a> &nbsp; [<a href="index.html#SEC_Contents" title="Table of contents" rel="contents">Contents</a>][<a href="Terminy-i-ukazateli.html" title="Index" rel="index">Index</a>]</p>
